title: "TAGS: Topological Analysis of Graph Structure"
abstract: "A two-pass RDF graph profiler that separates taxonomic (rdf:type) assertions from the instance-level structure before computing sixteen topological and semantic metrics, and exports them as W3C VoID/DQV profiles."
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
